            // exactly coincident with the surrounding shell walls (deck_width/deck_length match
            // the cavity cut exactly) — CGAL treats that as a degenerate zero-thickness seam
            // rather than a clean union, producing boundary edges + degenerate facets in the
            // exported mesh (confirmed via openscad-mesh-check.sh: 24 boundary edges / 16
            // degenerate facets in the default 4-deck/3-spacer config, traced here by bisection).
